      <description><![CDATA[
        The US Army is moving directed energy weapons from prototypes to the front lines. Now, Leonardo DRS is stepping in to solve the brutal engineering hurdles of fielding mobile lasers in combat.
        
        [SPLIT]
        ⚡ Leonardo DRS will supply critical rugged integration, power, and thermal management expertise for the LOCUST X3 laser weapon systems.
        [SPLIT]
        ⚡ The initiative addresses the urgent operational demand for cost-effective, non-kinetic layered defenses against proliferating battlefield drones.
        [SPLIT]
